problem_statement:
v63.0 margin is ignored for block inside inline-block
In v63.0 the margin is ignored for a div block if it is inside an inline-block element:

```
<html>
<head>
<style>
      .coverpage .coverpage-wrapper {
        display: table;
        width: 132.0mm;
        height: 271.0mm;
      }

      .coverpage .coverpage-cell {
        display: table-cell;
        width: 132.0mm;
        height: 271.0mm;
        vertical-align: middle;
      }

      .coverpage .coverpage-content {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 132.0mm;
      }

      .page-top {
        margin-top: 170.0mm;
        margin-bottom: 3.0mm;
      }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="main">
      <div class="coverpage">
        <div class="coverpage-wrapper">
          <div class="coverpage-cell">
            <div class="coverpage-content">
              <div class="page-top">
                Speisekarte
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
```

